==German==

===Etymology===
From obsolete {{m|de|tapissieren}}, borrowed in the 16th century from {{bor|de|frm|tapisser}}, a derivative of {{der|de|fro|tapiz}}, from {{der|de|grc|ταπήτιον}}. The modern German form under influence of the somewhat older noun {{m|de|Tapete}} and possibly {{der|de|it|tappezzare}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˌtapeˈtsiːʁən/|/-pə-/}}

